      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_00",
      "hash64": "93A3B6F57DD8E5EF",
      "text": "Hello? This is Saffron.[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_01",
      "hash64": "93A3B5F57DD8E43C",
      "text": "You have my thanks for inviting so many talented\\npeople to Blueberry Academy.[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_02",
      "hash64": "93A3B8F57DD8E955",
      "text": "I think you’ve earned yourself a special gift![VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_03",
      "hash64": "93A3B7F57DD8E7A2",
      "text": "Let’s see... How about the right to challenge\\nthe academy’s [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]secret boss[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] to a battle?[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_04",
      "hash64": "93A3B2F57DD8DF23",
      "text": "Swing by the academy entrance, why don’t you?[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_05",
      "hash64": "93A3B1F57DD8DD70",
      "text": "He’ll be waiting for you there. Anyway, talk to\\nyou later![VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_06",
      "hash64": "93A3B4F57DD8E289",
      "text": "Huh? Well, hello, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_07",
      "hash64": "93A3B3F57DD8E0D6",
      "text": "What’re you doing here? Waiting for someone?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_01",
      "hash64": "A1EED9B4A0548D8B",
      "text": "Yeah, the secret boss...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_02",
      "hash64": "A1EEDAB4A0548F3E",
      "text": "I was told to come here...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_08",
      "hash64": "93A3BEF57DD8F387",
      "text": "Oh, I gotcha![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_09",
      "hash64": "93A3BDF57DD8F1D4",
      "text": "Well, spoiler alert... As it turns out...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_10",
      "hash64": "93A030F57DD5CC66",
      "text": "Saffron was me! This whole time![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_11",
      "hash64": "93A031F57DD5CE19",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]You really breathed life into this academy,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nThe clubs, the students—you name it! Everyone’s\\nhaving the most fulfilling school life ever![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_12",
      "hash64": "93A02EF57DD5C900",
      "text": "As director, I am sincerely grateful. I take my\\nhat off to you.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_13",
      "hash64": "93A02FF57DD5CAB3",
      "text": "But y’see, I’m not just the director of Blueberry\\nAcademy...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_14",
      "hash64": "93A034F57DD5D332",
      "text": "As the strongest Trainer here, I’m also the secret\\nboss of this fine institution![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_15",
      "hash64": "93A035F57DD5D4E5",
      "text": "The BB League Champion is what you’d call the\\n“main” boss. But it’s more fun if there’s a secret\\r\\nboss that’s stronger, isn’t it?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_16",
      "hash64": "93A032F57DD5CFCC",
      "text": "I think you and I can have a real blast of a battle![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_17",
      "hash64": "93A033F57DD5D17F",
      "text": "No time to waste—let’s get this started.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_18",
      "hash64": "93A038F57DD5D9FE",
      "text": "I’m not going to hold back, OK? Try to hang in\\nthere![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_19",
      "hash64": "93A039F57DD5DBB1",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Wow, you’re good, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nIt’s\\r\\nbeen\\r\\na\\r\\nfew\\r\\ndecades\\r\\nsince\\r\\nmy\\r\\nlast\\r\\ndefeat![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
