    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_20",
      "hash64": "939CCAF57DD2E93D",
      "text": "Hold on, though... The BB League Champion just\\ndefeated the secret boss, which means...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_21",
      "hash64": "939CC9F57DD2E78A",
      "text": "That makes you the...Blueberry King? How do\\nyou fancy that name?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_21b",
      "hash64": "A6531424CD600F38",
      "text": "That makes you the...Blueberry Queen? How do\\nyou fancy that name?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_03",
      "hash64": "A1EEDBB4A05490F1",
      "text": "I like the sound of that!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_04",
      "hash64": "A1EEDCB4A05492A4",
      "text": "Uh, what are my other options?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_22",
      "hash64": "939CC8F57DD2E5D7",
      "text": "We’ll decide on a proper title later! For now, let\\nme offer you my congratulations![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_23",
      "hash64": "939CC7F57DD2E424",
      "text": "I think you deserve a special reward for defeating\\nthe secret boss![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "8E3ED08217B878F9",
      "text": "This is such a splendid occasion, though. I feel\\nlike I should give you something more...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "8E3ECF8217B87746",
      "text": "Oh, I know! How about we trade Pokémon?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "8E3ECE8217B87593",
      "text": "I’ll trade my Blitzle—what do you say?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "8E3ECD8217B873E0",
      "text": "Any Pokémon from you is more than welcome to\\ncome with me![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
